{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_title", "source_sha256": "b49831dcf401a537e734243bb9ac7ef8d5b344c514fb0819219ba97f42462816", "ja": "未来とおでかけ2", "zh": "和未来外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4085f4cc981dd7416e267e2ef7257bf656ca0b685469775923e94cf31241da51", "ja": "未来とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和未来一同外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "5587a592d7c94660cfb6dcc7e359e5a98035ad79f26b9bde947a48e115457179", "ja": "うわあ～、これが瀬戸大橋！？\nすごい、大きい！　向こうが見えない～！", "zh": "哇啊～，这就是濑户大桥吗！？\n好厉害，好大哦！都看不到对面了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0c6ff99f33731162fc8ec50fd25efa5bfa9e4bd6257613a2f9603333784ca556", "ja": "ああ、すごい迫力だな。\n瀬戸大橋は有名だし、未来も知ってたか。", "zh": "啊，真是气势惊人啊。\n濑户大桥很有名，未来你也知道啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "b5422968c844b2dc8b81dd1136619466e88f21b549a0a1055158029c2ade00b4", "ja": "はい！　私が香川に行くって言ったら、\n静香ちゃんがいろいろ教えてくれたんです。", "zh": "是的！我说要去香川的时候，静香还给我讲了好多东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "fae0ced4af66d83fc92acf56d57034176916e296a6f48318b9e0b6d9d21fb705", "ja": "あと、うどんの名店も、\nいっぱい教えてもらいましたよ！", "zh": "另外，她还告诉了我好多家有名的乌冬面店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f859dc5028ed90f66cb8d836116b8800eb361e6e0e39524da03f3bbf7f883594", "ja": "メインはそっちか……。そういえば、\nお土産のうどんの指定もされたな……。", "zh": "重点是那个啊……说起来，还指定了要带哪家店的乌冬面当伴手礼呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ac49c2a5203ff12dfb5151017fd41c36835307df7ae414b83cd0500e346bc412", "ja": "そうですね。静香ちゃんも一緒に来れたら\nよかったけど、南エリア担当じゃないですもんね。", "zh": "是啊。要是静香也能一起过来就好了，不过她不是负责南部区域的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4feadca90df283eaf935d2cfce4adc179bd93a689563ee0d82efc38013337f1", "ja": "静香は別のエリアに行く予定だからな。\nその時に、お土産話を聞かせてくれると思うよ。", "zh": "静香准备去别的区域。到时候她应该会给我们讲讲那边的见闻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "a1cd9991b4e6bc30b961537db4d18d824f91fb675ac70b39d35c9c4c41f1e305", "ja": "そっか。じゃあ私も、静香ちゃんに\nお土産話をたくさんしなくちゃですね♪", "zh": "这样啊。那我也得跟静香好好聊聊旅途见闻才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_014mir02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_014mir02_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "88cf77ebbb930afb4963d3f177b024148406fdb3fb2e5b40c9573cc94500602e", "ja": "じゃあまずは……瀬戸大橋と、記念撮影ですね！\n{$P$}さん、早く早くー♪", "zh": "那么首先……和{$P$}先生一起拍纪念照吧！\n快点快点——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
